WEBVTT

00:30:58.214 --> 00:31:01.250
RS: Well, we're worried
we're going to lose valuable information

00:31:01.274 --> 00:31:02.480
in the other direction.

00:31:02.504 --> 00:31:03.694
You know what?

00:31:03.718 --> 00:31:04.924
Let's look at the human

00:31:04.948 --> 00:31:06.798
before we look at the piece of paper.

00:31:07.457 --> 00:31:10.888
AG: Menlo's new hiring process
created this massive audition,

00:31:10.912 --> 00:31:12.285
where in just a few hours,

00:31:12.309 --> 00:31:13.738
they gather work samples,

00:31:13.762 --> 00:31:16.119
and current employees
select the candidates.

00:31:16.683 --> 00:31:17.869
How?

00:31:17.893 --> 00:31:20.239
Let a bunch of Menlo employees tell you.

00:31:20.263 --> 00:31:23.876
Meet Lisa, Helen,
George, Sara and Scott.

00:31:24.320 --> 00:31:28.299
Lisa: So we bring in about,
maybe, like, 30 to 50 candidates.

00:31:28.323 --> 00:31:31.197
Helen: The minute you walk
through the door, you get greeted.